{"id":"expl:packages/memory/src/attempt.ts@L60","kind":"explanation","commentRef":{"file":"packages/memory/src/attempt.ts","span":{"start":60,"end":65}},"file":"packages/memory/src/attempt.ts","span":{"start":60,"end":65},"lang":"typescript","hash":"blake3:629fe049235e6efc047e0bf7c71334dcbb57a5dacb4104ba6bb8094eba8c0f54","meta":{"text":"The attempt ids (from a flat event list) that are UNPROMOTED (no `promotion` event) AND whose last\nactivity is older than `maxAgeMs` (PRD line 359: \"garbage-collect unpromoted attempts after 30 days\nby default\"). Promoted attempts are never reaped (their compaction summary is a reusable success);\nan attempt with no events is ignored. PURE."}}
